NOTICE — Legal, interoperability, and clean-room statement
==========================================================

What this project is
--------------------
This project is an independent, clean-room reimplementation of a documented
software interface (ABI): the entry points that the MicroMill application and
the Imagenation PXC200 family of SDKs expose to one another. It was created for
the sole purpose of INTEROPERABILITY — letting the existing MicroMill
application continue to function by sourcing video from a standard, off-the-
shelf USB video-capture device instead of obsolete PCI frame-grabber hardware
that no longer has a working driver on modern Windows.

It is an aftermarket compatibility layer, not a competing product, and it adds
no feature of the original beyond what is needed to keep the application
running.

